[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4046458359","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117370#issuecomment-4046458359","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117370","id":4046458359,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7xMA33","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-12T12:41:22Z","updated_at":"2026-03-12T12:42:30Z","body":"As per our [optimization guidelines](https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/optimization.html), please provide evidence that this improves code performance.\r\nI'd also be interested in the motivation. Does anything lag noticeably from this method? Did you profile it to be a bottleneck?\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4046458359/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4046494752","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117370#issuecomment-4046494752","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117370","id":4046494752,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7xMJwg","user":{"login":"Kimau","id":905911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTkxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/905911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau","html_url":"https://github.com/Kimau","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-12T12:47:05Z","updated_at":"2026-03-12T12:47:05Z","body":"Can't post the specific platform metrics as it is PS5 Memory Analyzer dump. Our main issue wasn't a noticable lag or hitch to the user but rather an excessive amount of allocs making it hard to track down memory issues in said profiler because they happen at roughly the same time as compile errors. Also it was causing a lot of memory fragmentation.\r\n\r\nI could run the code through godbolt to prove the perf change. Though as I said unlikely to hit average user as it is only called by the compute shader compiler in public. Though we use it in a few other place.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4046494752/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4046582916","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117370#issuecomment-4046582916","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117370","id":4046582916,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7xMfSE","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-12T13:00:59Z","updated_at":"2026-03-12T13:03:53Z","body":"Ok. Well, a much simpler optimization that should also avoid almost all of the allocations at least would iterate the source string instead of relying on `split`. It should be possible to naively reserve `size()` for the dest string since it will be at least this large, so in total it should amount to only handful of allocations instead of possibly hundreds or thousands.\r\n\r\nThe implementation proposed here looks too complex for what it's trying to accomplish. At the very least, i would avoid the dual iteration since that is likely to actually make it slower than to help (compared to single iteration).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4046582916/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4046677870","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117370#issuecomment-4046677870","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117370","id":4046677870,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7xM2du","user":{"login":"Kimau","id":905911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTkxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/905911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau","html_url":"https://github.com/Kimau","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-12T13:15:50Z","updated_at":"2026-03-12T13:15:50Z","body":"Fair enough, it is more complex code.  As I said I call this function in a few other places.\r\n\r\nMy first impl was a single scan but then because I was adding it to public I split this up so that if the line number goes over 9999 you defo have the additional padding. Dual iteration is pretty damn fast with no cache misses, and unavoidable if you need a line count for the digits. \r\n\r\nAlso the relative complexity of vformat (using String::sprintf) vs snprintf \r\n\r\nOur core concern wasn't the speed but the single alloc vs multiple allocs as it was causing 100k+ allocs in a brief window.\r\nFine to have this one closed out as will not merge but was an easy patch to apply back so thought I would offer it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4046677870/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4046694657","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117370#issuecomment-4046694657","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117370","id":4046694657,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7xM6kB","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-12T13:18:16Z","updated_at":"2026-03-12T13:18:16Z","body":"> My first impl was a single scan but then because I was adding it to public I split this up so that if the line number goes over 9999 you defo have the additional padding. Dual iteration is pretty damn fast with no cache misses, and unavoidable if you need a line count for the digits.\r\n\r\nRight, that makes sense.\r\nNo need to close this. I'll have a closer look when I find the time.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4046694657/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]